1140
01:16:50,052 --> 01:16:52,612
and then...

1141
01:16:52,655 --> 01:16:55,852
they just... are.

1142
01:16:55,925 --> 01:16:58,485
MAN:
Samara...

1143
01:16:58,527 --> 01:17:01,963
I need you to start
telling me the truth, okay?

1144
01:17:01,997 --> 01:17:04,158
Can I see my mommy?

1145
01:17:04,199 --> 01:17:05,723
No, Samara.

1146
