1254
01:25:18,093 --> 01:25:20,755
It's in this television!

1255
01:25:20,796 --> 01:25:21,763
Come on!

1256
01:25:21,797 --> 01:25:22,889
Tell us now, why don't you?!

1257
01:25:22,931 --> 01:25:23,898
[ grunts ]

1258
01:25:23,932 --> 01:25:24,899
[ clattering ]

1259
01:25:24,933 --> 01:25:27,800
Noah...

1260
