[ stone scraping ]

1302
01:30:17,325 --> 01:30:19,293
[ grunting ]

1303
01:30:20,695 --> 01:30:21,923
Noah?

1304
01:30:21,963 --> 01:30:23,260
Noah!

1305
01:30:25,266 --> 01:30:26,858
[ static blips ]

1306
01:30:26,901 --> 01:30:28,300
[ grunting ]

1307
