1336
01:33:37,158 --> 01:33:38,250
Do you hear me?

1337
01:33:38,293 --> 01:33:40,989
It's past sunset!

1338
01:33:44,933 --> 01:33:47,731
Rachel?

1339
01:33:57,178 --> 01:33:59,169
Rachel?

1340
01:34:04,218 --> 01:34:07,119
