to help her.

1388
01:39:09,223 --> 01:39:10,884
It's okay now.

1389
01:39:10,925 --> 01:39:13,416
She's not going to hurt you.

1390
01:39:13,461 --> 01:39:14,951
She...

1391
01:39:21,035 --> 01:39:22,696
